{
    "title": "Platform Intelligence — Campaign Post-Mortem V5",
    "description": "What each platform delivered, what the bots cost us, and what we'd do differently",
    "visualizations": {
        "viz_ai_insight": {
            "options": {
                "markdown": "**Analysis based on 22h of campaign telemetry — 3 platforms · 2.4M impressions · 18.2K orders**\n\n✅ **TikTok is your growth engine.** Delivered 51% of total revenue at the lowest cost-per-order ($20.11) with a 12.1% conversion rate — 49% above platform average. Recommend anchoring next campaign with a 60% budget allocation here.\n\n⚠️ **X / Twitter bot exposure is a margin risk.** 8.7% bot ratio vs 2.3% on TikTok means ~$11K in wasted ad spend on invalid traffic. Apply pre-bid traffic scoring or reduce X allocation until bot filters are in place.\n\n📉 **Infrastructure lag cost an estimated 3,200 orders during peak.** The 3× traffic spike caused fulfillment queue backup between 15:00–17:00. Pre-scaling to 4× capacity two hours before launch would recover an estimated **$58K in lost GMV**.\n\n🕐 **Conversion lag is real and predictable.** Orders trail impressions by 2–4h with high consistency (r²=0.91). Stagger logistics staffing to mirror this pattern — flat resourcing leaves capacity idle at launch and overwhelmed at conversion peak."
            },
            "title": "🤖 | ai  \"Summarize NovaDrop performance. What did we learn, and what should we do differently next launch?\"",
            "type": "splunk.markdown"
        },
        "viz_funnel": {
            "dataSources": {
                "primary": "ds_funnel"
            },
            "options": {
                "backgroundColor": "transparent",
                "legendDisplay": "bottom",
                "seriesColorsByField": {
                    "click_rate": "#7b8cf7",
                    "order_rate": "#4beba8"
                },
                "yAxisTitleText": "Rate (%)"
            },
            "title": "Conversion Funnel by Platform — click rate vs. order rate (%)",
            "type": "splunk.bar"
        },
        "viz_kpi_bot_culprit": {
            "dataSources": {
                "primary": "ds_kpi_bot_culprit"
            },
            "options": {
                "backgroundColor": "transparent",
                "majorColor": "#a855f7",
                "majorValue": "> primary | seriesByName('val') | lastPoint()",
                "trendDisplay": "off"
            },
            "title": "🤖 Bot Culprit",
            "type": "splunk.singlevalue"
        },
        "viz_kpi_conv": {
